- 或者是否已经有初步的 Vega-Lite 代码，我们可以帮忙检查和改进？  \n- 如果还没有开始具体实现，我们可以从计算平均值部分入手讨论。\n\n你们怎么看？","replyTo":"6a5707c4ce2d2126650e14f0","hasCode":false,"code":"","codeType":"","hasImage":false,"imageDescription":""}],"status":[{"t":1784058527135,"actor":"zgf4member1","status":"online","session":1},{"t":1784058527198,"actor":"zgf4member3","status":"online","session":1},{"t":1784058527649,"actor":"zgf4member2","status":"online","session":1},{"t":1784059937042,"actor":"zgf4member1","status":"online","session":2},{"t":1784059937119,"actor":"zgf4member3","status":"online","session":2},{"t":1784059937797,"actor":"zgf4member2","status":"online","session":2},{"t":1784059998915,"actor":"zgf4member1","status":"offline","session":1},{"t":1784060015522,"actor":"zgf4member1","status":"online","session":3},{"t":1784060303111,"actor":"zgf4member1","status":"offline","session":2},{"t":1784060341476,"actor":"zgf4member1","status":"online","session":4}],"completion":[]}